# 3AM
v1.0.1

## What's New?

### Visual Changes
- Brand New App Icon: I've completed the app icon design! It now features a sleek, metallic gradient that matches the app's home screen, set against a pitch-black background for the "3AM" feel.
> Also Added: Adaptive Icon Support

### Under-the-Hood Improvements
- Lighter & Faster: I've enabled build optimizations (R8 shrinking) which significantly reduced the app's download (60MB -> ~6MB) size and overall performance.